{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Soulslike Combat</strong><br>The combat system revolves around stamina management and precise timing. Players can wield both melee and ranged weapons, combining them with diverse defensive mechanics such as parry, deflect, and block to adapt to any situation. Bosses feature varied skill sets and swift defensive reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc3 <strong>Stealth</strong><br>Guards patrol with tactical behavior and intelligent responses.<br>Enemies detect you through line of sight, footstep noise, and missed or landed attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Zombies</strong><br>Zombies move unpredictably, attack in hordes, and relentlessly close in with frenzied assaults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Lockpicking</strong><br>Unlock hidden areas or access safer alternative paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4107790?t=1771822793","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107790/fcd61e52bd2840b0f8c680fb4a703d5575702e98/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771822793","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107790/8540bb45622ea85317461adba99201b3bb44b843/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771822793","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107790/8540bb45622ea85317461adba99201b3bb44b843/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771822793","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4324690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Soulslike Combat</strong><br>The combat system revolves around stamina management and precise timing. Players can wield both melee and ranged weapons, combinin